  <system:String x:Key="tip.exps">Numerical and Option Modifiers:
    Left Click &amp; Drag: Assign dynamic expressions
    Shift + Left Click &amp; Drag: Assign uniform global expressions
    Right Click &amp; Drag: Clear expression data
Curve Modifiers:
    Left Click &amp; Drag: Sketch freehand curve
    Shift + Ctrl + Left Click: Draw linear interpolation
    Shift + Left Click: Draw horizontal plateau
    Right Click &amp; Drag: Erase curve segments</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="tip.exps.notsupported">The selected renderer does not support this specific expression.</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="tip.lyricbox.next">Tab: Advance to next note</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="tip.lyricbox.prev">Shift+Tab: Retreat to previous note</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="tip.notes.basics">Selection Tool
    Box Select: Highlight multiple notes
    Ctrl + Box Select: Append notes to current selection
    Up/Down Arrows: Transpose selection chromatically
    Ctrl + Up/Down Arrows: Transpose selection by full octaves
Pen Tool
    Left Click: Instantiate a new note
    Right Click: Delete targeted note
    Right Click &amp; Drag: Delete an array of notes
General Modifiers
    T: Toggle on-screen tooltips
    Drag Note Body: Translate note freely
    Drag Note Tail: Scale note duration
    Alt + Drag Note Tail: Scale duration without overlapping neighbors
    Spacebar: Toggle playback state</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="tip.notes.zoomx">◀ Manipulate this axis to adjust horizontal zoom ▶</system:String>
